WEBVTT

00:04:59.628 --> 00:05:04.342
When he died in 1666, 
he was buried next to Mumtaz,

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:08.137
his grave breaking the complex’s symmetry,

00:05:08.137 --> 00:05:13.309
so that his wife could remain 
at the Taj’s center for all eternity.

00:05:14.894 --> 00:05:18.356
This video was made possible with support
from Marriott Hotels.

00:05:18.356 --> 00:05:21.942
With over 590 hotels and resorts 
across the globe,

00:05:21.942 --> 00:05:25.946
Marriott Hotels celebrates the curiosity
that propels us to travel.

00:05:25.946 --> 00:05:29.700
Check out some of the exciting ways 
TED-Ed and Marriott are working together

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.244
and book your next journey
at Marriott Hotels.